WEBVTT

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:09.230
She moves in a strange way.

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:11.740
Her movements are full of openings.

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.860
Normally she'd have been defeated by now.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:21.330
I had my underlings look into her 
background, but they found very little.

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:28.420
The only thing they learned is that she works 
part-time for the Express Delivery Company.

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.260
Part-time?

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.460
That makes her even easier to 
poach than a regular employee.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.180
I doubt you know,

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:42.550
but part-time employees are exceptionally 
special at the Express Delivery Company.

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:44.380
Jo San, Jo Yon.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.580
Soran-kun? What about your match?

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:49.350
It's already over.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.640
Hou-nee's should be finished soon, right?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.990
Actually, she's struggling 
more than expected.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.720
You're wide open!

00:01:06.070 --> 00:01:10.130
If you can't use projectiles, 
you might as well admit defeat.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:19.470
48 Ultimate Techniques of the Monzetsu Fist.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:21.540
Bukkake.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:58.780
<b>9: Qimen Kenzou Shinpou</b>

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:17.550
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:02.010
Damn it!

00:03:02.010 --> 00:03:04.610
You tricked me! Ow!

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:08.580
You bastard! How 'bout this?

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:14.500
You'll never... beat... me!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:17.490
What? No way!

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:18.140
Seriously?

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:19.490
Hold on!

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.920
Shit, shit, shit!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:22.950
Wait, wait!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.110
Seriously?!

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:28.370
That's not fair!

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.450
You suck.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:33.450
It's the controller's fault.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.850
I guess we've entered an age of ranged 
combat over close quarters combat.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:45.280
Houhou, you could expand your repertoire 
by learning to use projectiles, too.

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.480
I'll try.

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:48.380
Huh?

00:03:57.770 --> 00:03:59.970
You're really gonna try this, Houhou?

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:03.910
It'd be convenient to learn to punch 
my opponents from a distance.

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:09.210
Ha...

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:10.060
Hahouken!

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:29.670
That's odd.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:31.240
I told you.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:34.520
Shooting balls of ki isn't that easy.

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:39.250
You can't without learning a special 
way of managing the flow of your ki.

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:44.350
If you really want to learn, 
I'll introduce you to a good master.

00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:46.390
That's not necessary.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:49.410
I already know what I'm doing wrong.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:53.590
I'm just not expelling enough ki.

00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.730
Th-This is...

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.210
A single hit from such a large 
ball of ki would take me out.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.670
Too bad.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:33.210
That's not fast enough to hit me.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:38.180
I see.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.050
Repeated Bukkake!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.070
<b>Repeated Bukkake</b>

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.870
Wh-What?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:01.370
<i>I'm curious what the other 48 Ultimate 
Techniques of the Monzetsu Fist are.</i>

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:07.770
Maybe they're crude, but they 
helped Houhou-chan win.

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:09.210
You can thank me for that.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:19.900
I'm unscathed?

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.510
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.440
<i>Was she not trying to damage me?</i>

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:30.640
<i>Was it poison? Paralysis? No, an illusion?</i>

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:34.400
It's still only strong enough 
to dent an empty can.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:35.800
<i>A can?</i>

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:42.630
What was that?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.810
I've never seen such an 
interesting girl before.

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:51.750
I was expecting a killer move, 
but she simply expelled balls of ki.

00:06:53.420 --> 00:07:00.560
If you imagine ki as money, normally you 
use that money to purchase weapons.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:06.430
But it's like she's desperately striking 
her opponent with those bills.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:13.880
And expending so much ki so recklessly would 
knock an ordinary person out before long.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.040
Looks like the rumors are true.

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:21.730
The part-time employees of the Express 
Delivery Company are far from ordinary.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.450
<i>Damn it! She tricked me!</i>

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:27.290
Hey, Houhou.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.870
Can't you make your Bukkake stronger?

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:32.640
I can't.

00:07:32.640 --> 00:07:34.670
I've only ever shot empty cans before.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:38.070
Then aim for his face when you—

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.320
You shut up!

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.510
My head...

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:43.310
Don't worry, Jo Yon.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.240
I won't lose.

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:47.360
His attacks won't work against me anymore.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.040
What?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:52.090
<i>Has she seen through my shinki?</i>

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:55.230
I won't fall for that bluff!

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:57.290
You don't stand a chance!

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.290
She dodged it?

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.660
She wasn't bluffing.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.770
<i>My shinki disperses over a wider 
area the farther it travels,</i>

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.530
<i>making it more difficult to evade.</i>

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:35.300
<i>While it's stronger up close, 
it's easier to avoid.</i>

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:41.290
<i>I'll admit it took guts to 
jump into melee range, but...</i>

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:50.970
<i>You can't escape my shinki!</i>

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>What?!</i>

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.500
It's over.

00:09:14.660 --> 00:09:20.080
How did Fuu Houhou learn to 
predict Shoushou's shinki?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.570
She wasn't predicting it.

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.560
She was watching Shoushou's breaths.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:29.570
Shinki is a style of kung fu in which you 
gather ki in your dantian and expel it.

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:33.180
It makes your throat, chest, 
and stomach appear

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:35.960
slightly different than 
normal while breathing.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:40.050
<i>Even if you understand 
it, it's still difficult</i>

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.520
<i>to observe such subtle changes 
while fighting an opponent.</i>

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:48.210
<i>Would I have the unwavering 
focus it takes to do that?</i>

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.240
Look at that!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.770
That's not good!

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:55.570
His soul's been shattered after 
taking a hit from his own shinki!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:01.420
Can't he control his own strength?

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:04.370
I suppose I'll go clean things up.

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:06.790
Wait, Tenshi.

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:10.160
Let's let the youngsters handle this.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:13.830
I'm sure there's something they can do.

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.670
She's trying to suck up all 
the fragments of his soul!

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.230
That girl really is a lovable idiot.

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:43.130
Let's see how long she can hold it in.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.990
Is Hou-nee okay?

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:06.770
Time for me to step in.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.320
Wait, Tenshi.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:15.930
Shiban Wagoujin.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:25.400
What's he doing?

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:30.420
Probably projecting a barrier so 
Shoushou's soul won't escape.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.560
You must be nearing your limit.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:41.240
<i>Now, how will we gather the soul fragments 
remaining inside the barrier?</i>

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:44.260
<i>It would be difficult even 
for my Qimen Dunjia.</i>

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:49.950
Sheesh.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:53.020
You're one reckless girl.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:05.000
Fuu Houhou!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:08.740
Give me the fragments in your mouth, too.

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:17.910
Now return!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:30.340
He should be fine now.

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:31.300
Okay.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:35.520
He's unconscious, but his soul 
has returned to his body.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.200
See? I was right.

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:46.650
The young deserve our respect.

00:12:47.650 --> 00:12:50.070
Fuu Houhou wins!

00:12:50.890 --> 00:12:53.320
<i>Ouya and Fuu Houhou, huh?</i>

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:56.870
<i>Reigyoku-dono was right.</i>

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.640
<i>It seems the Shokatsu family 
has become too detached</i>

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.210
<i>from the world and now
knows nothing about it.</i>

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.340
Wait, Ouya.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:13.650
Now that you're both here, 
why don't we begin your match?

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:17.090
Oh. Sure, I guess.

00:13:18.140 --> 00:13:22.750
Then the match between Ouya and 
Shokatsu Sei will now begin!

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:28.940
Ouya-san...

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:32.700
He may be a master of tai chi,

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:35.830
but who knows if it'll work against 
Shokatsu Sei's Qimen Dunjia.

00:13:36.550 --> 00:13:39.800
Ouya-dono, I admire your kung fu.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:40.760
Huh?

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:45.510
But I find your lack of enthusiasm 
for the match unsatisfactory.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.370
Lack of enthusiasm?

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.010
Maybe you're right.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.660
But it depends on my opponent.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:13:59.680
<i>He's fast.</i>

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:03.010
<i>His palms are incredibly strong.</i>

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:07.270
<i>If I let myself get caught in the flow of 
his ki, I'll be swept away by his pace!</i>

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:09.110
Inshu!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.160
<i>Gotcha.</i>

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.170
<i>Bajiquan, huh?</i>

00:14:28.440 --> 00:14:32.840
Ouya-dono, don't you think 
you're rushing too much?

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:38.940
I have never once misjudged 
an opponent's strength.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:43.660
I wish you wouldn't misjudge mine.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:47.630
Is your Qimen Dunjia next?

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:51.330
You really have learned 
a bunch of techniques.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:54.880
Gon...

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:56.960
Konron!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:04.130
Not moving?

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.120
You fortified yourself.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:12.710
Surely you don't think you can beat 
me with your tai chi alone.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.950
Well, I didn't think I'd win easily.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:19.900
Hmph.

00:15:20.300 --> 00:15:24.210
I can't believe my tai chi 
is completely ineffective.

00:15:24.210 --> 00:15:25.640
That's depressing.

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:28.410
Kan Suidan!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:41.590
<i>Ouya-san and Shokatsu Sei are 
both attacking aggressively.</i>

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.390
<i>What are they trying to accomplish?</i>

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:48.720
He dispersed his own water bolts 
by making them hit each other!

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.300
He blocked it with his bare hands?

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.710
Taijiquan Youshu!

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:02.050
Kon Kawaguruma!

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.530
Kon Ryuuseki!

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.180
Thanks, Shokatsu Sei.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:20.200
If you hadn't held back, 
that attack would've killed me.

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:23.250
You don't need to thank me.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.720
These matches are meant to 
be friendly competition.

00:16:26.140 --> 00:16:29.870
We're not trying to kill each other.

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:34.390
But you seem to be holding 
back quite a bit, as well.

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.190
Huh?

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:39.550
You're a fangshi like me.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.290
Or am I wrong?

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.670
Ouya-san's a fangshi, too?

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:51.560
Fangshi are seen as eccentric 
outsiders by ordinary people.

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:54.740
We're thought of as illogical.

00:16:54.740 --> 00:17:00.320
But that's simply because they 
don't understand fangshi.

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:05.260
Fangshi are actually more 
logical than anyone else.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:08.340
We search for the laws hidden in all things,

00:17:08.820 --> 00:17:11.470
avoiding ill fortune and seeking good luck.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:16.580
I realized something during your 
match against Tetsu Baryuu.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:24.170
His kung fu was strong enough 
to overwhelm even you.

00:17:24.780 --> 00:17:30.050
But you easily blocked his kung fu.

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:36.480
It's because you were always standing in 
that moment's direction of good fortune.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:40.340
Luck was on your side the whole time.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:46.740
Yes, all your movements are logical.

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:55.250
I doubt I could become friends with someone 
who sees through people like you do.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.080
So it's safe to assume I'm right?

00:17:59.410 --> 00:18:04.430
I wanted to finish this before you 
broke out your Qimen Dunjia,

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.890
but it looks like I was naïve.

00:18:07.840 --> 00:18:09.450
Hey, Shokatsu Sei.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.500
Have you ever lost before?

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.830
Excluding my matches against my master, no.

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.560
Can you accept defeat?

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:24.700
A defeat so crushing, it denies your 
entire life up until this moment?

00:18:27.980 --> 00:18:30.150
We're both fangshi.

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.170
Let's not waste time on pointless 
battles and settle this sensibly.

00:18:35.520 --> 00:18:40.500
Why not avoid ill fortune and 
seek good luck, like you said?

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:43.640
I'll give you some time to think about it.

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:48.400
What's going on? They suddenly stopped.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.480
What are they discussing?

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:54.720
This is an unexpected development.

00:19:03.270 --> 00:19:07.650
A fangshi should surrender himself 
to the course of the heavens.

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:12.200
Shokatsu Sei, I'm not trying to insult you.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:18.050
I don't mean to be too persistent, 
but go home, Shokatsu Sei.

00:19:18.860 --> 00:19:21.510
It's your best option.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.860
Ouya-dono.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:37.000
I just divined my own fate and 
received the following verse.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:42.590
"The summer bug flies towards the flame."

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.570
Kon Kawaguruma!

00:19:46.110 --> 00:19:48.240
Kon Kawaguruma.

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:51.270
What?!

00:19:57.340 --> 00:20:01.430
How can he use Kon's Kawaguruma 
from his position at Son?

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.640
And it's far stronger than mine!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.200
Ri Sekiren!

00:20:07.200 --> 00:20:09.660
Son Kadan Kudoku!

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.850
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:16.510
<i>It's impossible for even the 
greatest users of Qimen Dunjia</i>

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:19.500
<i>to not follow the laws of Seikoku!</i>

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:23.610
<i>A wood technique should never 
beat a fire technique!</i>

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:41.010
What secrets does his Qimen Dunjia hide?

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.100
Well, Shokatsu Sei?

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.680
Shall we continue?

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:55.030
If you've divined your own fate, 
then you must know this is pointless.

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.340
<i>He's right.</i>

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:02.810
<i>I'll no doubt experience a defeat 
so crushing I'll lose all dignity.</i>

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:07.870
<i>But there's something more important 
than dignity to a fangshi.</i>

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.530
<i>And that is...</i>

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:12.500
The truth!

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.960
Hey, what's that light?

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:26.980
Qimen Kenzou Shinpou!

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:27.850
<b>Qimen Kenzou Shinpou</b>

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.010
Sei-nii... Stop!

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:45.920
<i>Even if I can't avoid defeat,
I want to know how I was defeated.</i>

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:52.880
I'll see with my own eyes the truth 
hidden behind your Qimen Dunjia.

00:21:56.370 --> 00:22:00.090
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:04.050
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:08.140
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

00:22:08.340 --> 00:22:12.060
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:12.220 --> 00:22:16.190
But I don’t want any if you 
don’t cook them with red peppers

00:22:17.650 --> 00:22:20.270
Cute, cute girl

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:24.150
She has such a calm face

00:22:24.360 --> 00:22:28.070
But with her giant shovel, she 
goes from one hill to the next

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.660
And fills them with holes

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:35.910
I don’t know where she came from

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:39.750
But if you make her mad, she’ll punch you

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:43.880
She’s always in a daze, 
but she’s terrifying

00:22:44.090 --> 00:22:47.680
She’ll smack you without 
warning if you’re stupid

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:51.800
Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn’t shine

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.770
This dignified girl is never scared

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:59.850
She works hard all night burying

00:23:00.100 --> 00:23:04.020
She buries others in order to survive

00:23:04.400 --> 00:23:08.280
The sun came up, aiya, and it’s 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:12.160
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:16.040
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they’re fat and look delicious

